WEBVTT

00:02.934 --> 00:05.234
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:05.364 --> 00:08.394
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.904 --> 00:11.644
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.644 --> 00:16.274
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.714 --> 00:23.674
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:25.424 --> 00:28.294
Dragon Drive

00:28.294 --> 00:33.784
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.934 --> 00:36.904
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.904 --> 00:40.134
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.634 --> 00:45.004
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:45.004 --> 00:46.974
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.974 --> 00:53.284
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:55.014 --> 00:57.384
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:57.384 --> 01:00.584
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.924 --> 01:05.924
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.924 --> 01:07.484
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.634 --> 01:10.034
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:10.034 --> 01:13.164
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.574 --> 01:18.644
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.644 --> 01:21.374
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:21.374 --> 01:29.044
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:42.634 --> 01:44.194
Wh-What's wrong, everyone?

01:52.244 --> 01:54.434
Stop it! Don't fight back!

01:56.984 --> 02:00.274
I can feel it. I know what the dragons feel.

02:00.384 --> 02:04.114
Where is it that
the four dragons assaulted you?

02:05.484 --> 02:07.254
It's a horrible place.

02:07.794 --> 02:09.694
But we have to go...

02:09.924 --> 02:12.254
...in order to save Rikyu and the dragons.

02:13.864 --> 02:17.294
Memory

02:20.434 --> 02:21.364
What?!

02:21.434 --> 02:24.034
Is that the only lead you've got?!

02:24.204 --> 02:26.034
Y-Yeah. That's right.

02:26.304 --> 02:28.704
But at least it's a half step forward.

02:28.874 --> 02:31.344
Kouhei doesn't have
that piece of information.

02:31.414 --> 02:32.774
Stop bragging!

02:33.384 --> 02:36.714
Leave your bragging until you find
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons!

02:36.784 --> 02:37.754
Okay, Reiji?!

02:37.824 --> 02:39.514
S-Sorry.

02:43.824 --> 02:46.854
So, the only person who knows the location
of the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons...

02:47.594 --> 02:49.184
...is you, Meguru.

02:49.764 --> 02:52.204
There's a chance Kouhei
may come after you.

02:53.704 --> 02:56.064
Hmph! I've had enough of your quibbles!

02:58.944 --> 03:01.504
Okay! This time, I'll go.

03:01.644 --> 03:04.044
I'll find the Shrine of the
Four Sacred Dragons for you!

03:04.114 --> 03:05.514
- Huh?!
- Maiko!

03:05.584 --> 03:07.774
Leave everything to me!
I'm the most reliable!

03:07.914 --> 03:09.114
Okay, okay.

03:09.454 --> 03:12.424
Daisuke's a bit too enthusiastic about this.

03:12.484 --> 03:13.714
Why would that be?

03:14.024 --> 03:15.854
I'm guessing it had to do with that time...

03:16.294 --> 03:18.854
I'm counting on you, Daisuke.

03:19.594 --> 03:22.394
She's... counting on me.

03:23.904 --> 03:24.994
Hooray!

03:26.034 --> 03:27.734
I shouldn't have said what I said.

03:28.034 --> 03:30.164
Daisuke! Take me with you!

03:32.844 --> 03:34.074
I'll help, too.

03:34.374 --> 03:37.344
I can no longer sit back and watch while
everyone else is out there fighting!

03:37.814 --> 03:39.244
I can't stand it anymore!

03:43.384 --> 03:44.914
But, Meguru...

03:45.024 --> 03:47.714
...your memory of the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons...

03:48.324 --> 03:50.054
Allow me to go, Elder.

03:50.464 --> 03:52.184
We have a lead to where it is.

03:52.464 --> 03:53.754
If we go there...

03:53.864 --> 03:56.334
...I should be able to remember what I saw!

04:00.004 --> 04:03.764
You may end up bringing back
some painful memories!

04:04.244 --> 04:05.434
Are you sure about this?

04:05.504 --> 04:06.374
Yes!

04:06.444 --> 04:08.004
Then I'll go, too.

04:08.114 --> 04:10.134
I don't wanna be too far away from her.

04:10.584 --> 04:12.204
Then me too!

04:12.584 --> 04:15.774
Great! Maiko's coming with me.

04:15.884 --> 04:18.444
She really is relying on me.

04:29.134 --> 04:30.594
Will they be all right?

04:31.204 --> 04:33.034
Daisuke and Ichirou, I mean.

04:33.704 --> 04:35.334
Let's let them handle things.

04:35.904 --> 04:38.494
We have other things we must take care of.

04:41.774 --> 04:44.474
Ah... Mr. Kouhei?

04:44.814 --> 04:45.644
Hm?

04:46.714 --> 04:49.374
We haven't stopped flying since yesterday.

04:49.954 --> 04:51.684
Right. You tired?

04:51.784 --> 04:52.884
Shall we take a break?

04:53.224 --> 04:54.714
That's not what I meant...

04:54.854 --> 04:56.984
I was just wondering where we're headed.

04:58.724 --> 05:01.524
Why do you want to know that?
Will you run off and tell your friends?!

05:01.994 --> 05:04.624
If you keep on with
those rude remarks, I'll get angry!

05:05.434 --> 05:08.704
Hey, both of you. Let's not fight.

05:10.104 --> 05:11.094
Sayaka.

05:11.244 --> 05:14.874
The truth is, I have no idea
where I should be going.

05:14.974 --> 05:18.774
Th-Then are you saying we've been flying
all this time with no destination in mind?

05:19.584 --> 05:20.544
Yeah.

05:22.154 --> 05:24.674
I thought this thing
would tell me something.

05:26.824 --> 05:28.344
Don't you know, Sayaka?

05:29.154 --> 05:31.554
I wish I had some idea where to go...

05:31.964 --> 05:34.024
So you have no idea, Mr. Kouhei?

05:34.294 --> 05:37.264
No. I have no clue, so I'm stuck.

05:38.804 --> 05:43.364
The Dragonite is a key to the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons.

05:44.474 --> 05:45.464
Very well!

05:45.544 --> 05:47.944
I will find out the location for you!

05:48.244 --> 05:50.674
Really? You have a lead?

05:51.384 --> 05:53.674
I may be able to get the information
from a certain source.

05:53.984 --> 05:55.174
Can I count on you?

05:55.414 --> 05:56.384
Of course!

05:56.454 --> 06:00.754
You can leave... things... to... me!

06:01.454 --> 06:02.824
Here I go!

06:08.134 --> 06:09.824
Is it wise to let her go off alone like that?

06:12.004 --> 06:13.834
Not to worry. Not to worry.

06:23.314 --> 06:26.004
No. This may not be the location.

06:28.214 --> 06:30.514
Are you all right?
Don't push yourself too hard.

06:33.554 --> 06:35.384
It doesn't seem to be in this direction.

06:36.024 --> 06:37.654
Let's head east.

06:37.894 --> 06:39.984
I think it's west.

06:40.164 --> 06:43.364
Hey! Why do you keep contradicting me
on every single thing?!

06:43.804 --> 06:46.464
I'm just giving my opinion!

06:46.634 --> 06:48.334
D-Damn you!

06:49.474 --> 06:50.594
Stop it, you two!

06:50.674 --> 06:52.104
Don't stop me, Maiko!

06:52.204 --> 06:54.674
If I say right, he says left!

06:54.744 --> 06:56.604
If I say ahead, he says behind!

06:56.744 --> 06:58.274
He just wants to contradict me
on everything!

06:58.714 --> 07:01.304
Don't forget, this guy was with RI-ON!

07:01.414 --> 07:04.014
Just being on our side now
isn't reason enough to trust him!

07:04.124 --> 07:07.524
Please don't be so persistent
in bringing up my past, Daisuke.

07:07.754 --> 07:11.124
The... way... you... say...
stuff... like... that...

07:11.194 --> 07:13.384
...is what I hate about you the most!

07:13.464 --> 07:16.624
Stop it! Both of you!

07:17.434 --> 07:19.564
Ichirou! Let's go east!

07:19.834 --> 07:20.894
Fine.

07:20.974 --> 07:23.964
When we don't find it, we can always
come back and go west.

07:24.604 --> 07:25.834
Damn you!

07:25.904 --> 07:27.734
- Daisuke!
- Y-Yes?

07:27.814 --> 07:30.214
Stop complaining
and head east with us!

07:30.884 --> 07:31.844
Right.

07:35.184 --> 07:37.414
Will I hafta go through this every time?

07:38.054 --> 07:39.814
Let's go, Chibi!

08:00.374 --> 08:02.244
Our battle with Kouhei is approaching!

08:03.014 --> 08:06.004
I must train until I have this power
under full control!

08:14.024 --> 08:18.724
You saw my brother die,
and came back like nothing had happened!

08:24.804 --> 08:25.994
Chibi! Fire!!

08:35.214 --> 08:37.904
What's wrong, Reiji?! Your aim is way off!

08:40.244 --> 08:42.344
I'm unable to control this power.

08:44.124 --> 08:45.584
Am I still not good enough?!

08:50.724 --> 08:51.594
Hey!

08:51.994 --> 08:53.754
Sayaka, where were you all this time?

08:53.834 --> 08:55.294
I was worried, you know!

08:55.564 --> 08:57.554
And... jump!

09:01.034 --> 09:02.664
So you really were worried about me, huh?

09:02.734 --> 09:05.104
Could it be because you're in love with me?

09:05.174 --> 09:07.364
W-Well, I wouldn't go that far...

09:07.574 --> 09:08.734
Oh, you're just being shy!

09:15.154 --> 09:17.584
Um... where is Kyoji?

09:17.784 --> 09:20.274
H-He's inside. Shall I get him for you?

09:20.594 --> 09:23.084
No! Never mind!

09:24.094 --> 09:26.084
I can't have him see me here.

09:29.894 --> 09:32.524
Because Kyoji's already seen me
as a member of the enemy.

09:35.274 --> 09:37.134
Um... what about Meguru?

09:37.204 --> 09:38.004
Meguru?

09:38.074 --> 09:39.594
You have something to talk to her about?

09:39.674 --> 09:41.264
Yeah. Sort of.

09:41.744 --> 09:43.264
She went east with Daisuke and Maiko...

09:43.474 --> 09:46.574
...to find the Shrine of
the Four Sacred Dragons.

09:47.144 --> 09:48.114
East it is!

09:49.414 --> 09:50.544
Sayaka!

09:55.054 --> 09:56.614
She's certainly acting strange.

10:00.224 --> 10:02.124
Reiji. Let's take a break here.

10:03.194 --> 10:04.964
That's fine by me. What's the matter?

10:05.464 --> 10:06.494
Just something.

10:19.784 --> 10:22.444
The fact that Maiko's together with them...

10:23.054 --> 10:25.954
...suggests they're traveling with Gholaoh,
who is unable to fly.

10:26.784 --> 10:28.344
Which means...

10:30.224 --> 10:32.494
They can't be too far from here!

10:59.224 --> 11:00.184
Well?

11:01.824 --> 11:03.124
I don't think it's here.

11:03.454 --> 11:05.224
Then it must be west.

11:06.364 --> 11:08.454
That's what I said right from the beginning.

11:08.534 --> 11:09.554
What?!

11:10.334 --> 11:12.264
How were we to know unless we checked?!

11:12.804 --> 11:14.774
I just thought it wasn't efficient!

11:15.004 --> 11:17.874
- Damn! You do nothing but talk!
- How dare you!

11:17.944 --> 11:20.174
Will you please stop it, you two?!

11:20.304 --> 11:22.034
Enough is enough!

11:25.414 --> 11:26.544
Hi!

11:27.214 --> 11:28.844
S-Sayaka.

11:31.924 --> 11:34.154
Where have you been all this time, Sayaka?

11:34.224 --> 11:35.454
We were worried.

11:35.554 --> 11:37.614
Oh, my! Sorry for the trouble!

11:41.034 --> 11:43.054
Meguru, I looked all over for you.

11:43.164 --> 11:44.354
Huh? Me?

11:45.034 --> 11:46.594
Please come with me.

11:47.264 --> 11:49.464
There's something I'd like to show you.

11:50.174 --> 11:51.164
Wait a minute.

11:52.504 --> 11:54.444
I'll tag along, if you don't mind.

11:55.244 --> 11:58.944
Actually, we're having some girl talk,
so could you please excuse us?

12:04.184 --> 12:05.584
I get it!

12:11.124 --> 12:13.094
Kouhei! What are you doing here?

12:14.064 --> 12:15.424
I had forgotten all about her.

12:16.464 --> 12:17.764
Meguru.

12:18.434 --> 12:21.764
You know how to use
this thing properly, don't you?

12:22.034 --> 12:23.594
Won't you please tell me?

12:31.884 --> 12:33.674
I'll bring the dishes, Mr. Taiyou.

12:33.784 --> 12:35.444
Never mind. It's all right.

12:37.114 --> 12:40.484
In any case, we need to have Chibisuke
get his strength back.

12:43.754 --> 12:45.384
Hand Meguru over to me.

12:45.764 --> 12:47.254
You don't expect me to say "yes", do you?

12:51.534 --> 12:53.294
Ichirou! You can't fight him alone!

12:53.364 --> 12:54.634
Don't worry!

12:54.774 --> 12:56.934
I'll show you that I'm more than just talk!

12:58.874 --> 13:02.334
Ichirou, didn't you say you'd show me
that you're more than just talk?

13:03.014 --> 13:05.204
Can you at least put up a fight?

13:10.654 --> 13:12.214
Where are you aiming?

13:13.854 --> 13:15.984
Don't forget about me!

13:24.564 --> 13:26.154
Why did they have to come?

13:26.234 --> 13:30.724
I was going to get the information
on the Shrine from Meguru.

13:37.814 --> 13:39.614
Wow. Not bad.

13:40.544 --> 13:42.604
Don't expect to beat us so easily!

13:42.714 --> 13:43.844
"Us", you say?

13:44.584 --> 13:46.914
Well, give me all you've got.

13:53.494 --> 13:56.624
Why couldn't she just tell me
where the Shrine is?

14:17.354 --> 14:19.084
Return! Floralfoehn!

14:35.004 --> 14:36.734
Is there no end to this?!

15:03.034 --> 15:04.764
Ichirou. I...

15:05.064 --> 15:07.764
I just remembered it!

15:07.834 --> 15:09.664
I!

15:12.704 --> 15:14.694
Keep it forgotten for a little longer.

15:15.674 --> 15:18.164
Tell me once we've sent Kouhei away.

15:18.384 --> 15:19.344
Okay?

15:26.154 --> 15:27.124
Please.

15:28.124 --> 15:29.284
I hope we're not going to be too late!

15:43.534 --> 15:44.634
Daisuke!

15:45.944 --> 15:48.844
I think you'd be far better off
just handing Meguru over to me!

15:49.144 --> 15:51.804
Sorry. I promised her that I'd protect her!

15:51.944 --> 15:55.814
Hey, it's not easy holding back
while attacking, you know!

15:56.584 --> 15:58.314
Then why don't you leave?

15:58.724 --> 16:00.714
I'm afraid that's not possible!

16:12.034 --> 16:13.694
Well, it looks like it's "game over".

16:15.234 --> 16:15.934
Get lost!

16:16.004 --> 16:17.804
Kouhei!

16:21.574 --> 16:23.374
What?! Here already?!

16:23.444 --> 16:24.504
That's fast.

16:29.114 --> 16:31.314
Kouhei! We'll be your opponents now!

16:32.454 --> 16:35.584
Hey kid! I'll put an end to you this time!

16:37.424 --> 16:40.414
Your opponent is not Mr. Kouhei! It's me!

16:40.794 --> 16:42.224
Mr. Kouhei?!

16:42.294 --> 16:44.494
Have you teamed up with him?!

16:44.704 --> 16:45.924
So what if I did?

16:46.034 --> 16:47.764
You have no idea!

16:48.004 --> 16:48.974
Shut up!

16:52.044 --> 16:53.164
Mahiru.

16:54.074 --> 16:55.704
Can't you hear me, Mahiru?

16:57.314 --> 17:01.074
The man you hate is me, right?

17:02.414 --> 17:03.884
Isn't that right?

17:04.784 --> 17:07.914
Mahiru! Go ahead and hate me!

17:11.624 --> 17:14.184
Ichirou. Meguru. Are you all right?

17:14.534 --> 17:15.464
Yeah.

17:15.534 --> 17:17.464
Though we almost didn't make it.

17:17.964 --> 17:20.934
Sorry! If only I were stronger...

17:21.174 --> 17:22.224
It's okay.

17:23.204 --> 17:25.264
Even the weak can accomplish things...

17:25.344 --> 17:28.004
...by working together.

17:29.114 --> 17:31.044
Sure, we have our differences...

17:31.114 --> 17:33.244
...but we're on the same team, right?

17:35.754 --> 17:37.244
Ichirou.

17:38.784 --> 17:41.414
Let's do it, Mr. Taiyou! Kyoji!

17:41.654 --> 17:42.384
Right!

17:46.894 --> 17:48.884
Darn. You guys just keep coming.

17:55.074 --> 17:58.434
There you have it! Our friendship power!

18:04.144 --> 18:06.634
Mahiru! Stop fooling around and help me!

18:26.234 --> 18:28.534
What's the matter?! You hate me, right?!

18:29.374 --> 18:31.134
Then come and get me!

18:37.784 --> 18:40.874
That doesn't hurt one bit, Mahiru.

18:41.114 --> 18:42.314
Sore loser!

18:42.384 --> 18:44.874
If you wanna defeat me,
come at me with everything you've got!

18:45.024 --> 18:46.644
D-Don't underestimate me!

18:50.754 --> 18:51.984
That's good.

18:52.224 --> 18:53.994
Much better, Mahiru.

18:55.434 --> 18:57.664
SinnSaber!

19:16.014 --> 19:17.504
Not that again!

19:21.624 --> 19:22.884
Meguru!

19:23.054 --> 19:24.854
I'll be back!

19:26.224 --> 19:28.924
We're not letting you place
a single finger on her!

19:48.114 --> 19:49.084
Mahiru!

19:51.324 --> 19:54.014
I hate to bother you while you're having fun,
but we're leaving.

19:54.084 --> 19:55.314
B-But!

19:55.994 --> 19:58.324
It wouldn't be any fun for us
to finish things off here.

19:58.664 --> 20:00.954
Let's save the fun for later.

20:11.274 --> 20:14.734
Come back anytime you wish, bastard.

20:20.914 --> 20:23.854
Are you all right, everyone?

20:26.524 --> 20:27.484
Sayaka.

20:27.954 --> 20:29.754
You're too late-it's all over.

20:30.854 --> 20:33.054
Th-That's a rude welcome, don't you think?

20:33.124 --> 20:34.594
She's right.

20:37.494 --> 20:41.094
It was Sayaka who came to tell us
that you were in trouble.

20:41.304 --> 20:43.034
I think a "thank you" is in order.

20:43.104 --> 20:44.974
Ah, thank you.

20:47.374 --> 20:49.404
Welcome back, Sayaka.

20:53.414 --> 20:56.214
It may only be temporary.

20:57.014 --> 21:00.284
Well, the important thing
is that everyone is safe.

21:07.064 --> 21:11.054
But isn't Kouhei just toying with us?

21:12.464 --> 21:13.764
Toying with all of us.

21:13.834 --> 21:16.534
No, we can win this thing.

21:17.834 --> 21:20.634
Kouhei Toki does not know where
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons is.

21:20.804 --> 21:21.634
However...

21:21.714 --> 21:23.044
Meguru, are you saying...

21:23.114 --> 21:24.514
I remember.

21:25.884 --> 21:28.974
I finally remember where the Shrine
of the Four Sacred Dragons is!

21:30.914 --> 21:32.884
It's a very dangerous place.

21:33.454 --> 21:36.684
But if we get there first,
we can stop Kouhei Toki.

21:36.794 --> 21:39.284
We can stop RI-ON!

21:57.674 --> 22:00.344
taikutsu datta
I was bored

22:00.414 --> 22:03.114
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:03.184 --> 22:07.124
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.594 --> 22:11.284
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:11.364 --> 22:13.524
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.994 --> 22:18.094
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:19.534 --> 22:22.124
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:22.204 --> 22:24.864
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.944 --> 22:28.894
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:30.244 --> 22:32.674
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.744 --> 22:35.684
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.754 --> 22:40.624
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:41.294 --> 22:43.954
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:44.024 --> 22:46.724
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.794 --> 22:51.424
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:52.164 --> 22:54.864
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.934 --> 22:57.534
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.604 --> 23:02.234
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.914 --> 23:07.404
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:08.354 --> 23:14.014
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:16.194 --> 23:18.884
Next time

23:19.124 --> 23:20.214
All right!

23:20.294 --> 23:22.724
We know the location of
the Shrine of the Four Sacred Dragons!

23:23.594 --> 23:25.824
Now, we can keep Shinryu from RI-ON!

23:25.904 --> 23:26.994
Way to go!

23:27.064 --> 23:30.564
And just when everything's going well...
wh-wh-what's this?!

23:30.974 --> 23:33.064
A wormhole in space-time is opening?!

23:33.144 --> 23:34.834
Open the door, please!

23:34.914 --> 23:37.274
Who in the world is arriving now?!

23:37.774 --> 23:39.834
Next, on Dragon Drive, "The Boy".

23:40.084 --> 23:43.074
What? You mean it's a boy arriving?!

23:43.284 --> 23:45.844
The Boy
What's your name, please?!
